	"Description": "Xtarfur hasn't been updated for a while so I fixed some things here and there and added some missing pixel art (not impressive art mind you).\n<br />\n<br />In essence this mod makes Anthro Characters Continued workwith Xtardew Valley and Stardew Valley Expanded. \n<br />\n<br />So now you can have your Stardew Valley experience both: expanded, xxxsified and furryfied. You lucky devil!\n<br />\n<br />Feel free to use until [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/2512865]zellgoma[/url] returns.\n<br />\n<br />It doesn't quite cover everything but is slightly better than nothing.\n<br />\n<br />Mental hugs,\n<br />\n<br />Byeee\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Just install the requirements and then paste this mod on top - accept overwrite.\n<br />\n<br />I believe in you! &lt;3",
